lly have for testing.\n\nI've tried fiddling with every shadow-related option in the project settings, and the phenomenon yet persists.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWhile the project is running, try changing the LightOccluder2D further away from the camera, the window size, or the camera zoom\n\nExamples:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/218ff861-4d2a-4581-b0a9-90923941181f\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6034064-ed2d-489f-b40a-20ffa8954804\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[ShadowTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29118068/ShadowTest.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"BluesM18A1","id":36201999,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MjAxOTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36201999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1","html_url":"https://github.com/BluesM18A1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120427/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}